1
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

2
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[metallic clinking]</b></font>

3
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:16,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[continues whimpering]</b></font>

4
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[man 1 grunts]</b></font>

5
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:23,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[boy crying]</b></font>

6
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:26,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[man 2 gasping, panting]</b></font>

7
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:28,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[man 3 grunts]</b></font>

8
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:33,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[boy crying]</b></font>

9
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:41,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ tense music playing]</b></font>

10
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:45,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

11
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:47,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Press forward!</b></font>

12
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:49,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Protect the villagers!</b></font>

13
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:51,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[soldier panting]</b></font>

14
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:52,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

15
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:55,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[soldiers screaming]</b></font>

16
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

17
00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:03,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

18
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:22,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[soldier gasps]</b></font>

19
00:01:27,670 --> 00:01:29,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

20
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:36,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

21
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:05,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>BEYOND JOURNEY'S END</b></font>

22
00:03:02,850 --> 00:03:05,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EPISODE 34:
A DEMON-SLAYING REQUEST</b></font>

23
00:03:05,850 --> 00:03:09,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>30 YEARS AFTER THE DEATH
OF HIMMEL THE HERO,</b></font>

24
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:12,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IN THE RUFEN REGION,
LOCATED ON THE NORTHERN PLATEAU</b></font>

25
00:03:13,690 --> 00:03:15,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

26
00:03:28,380 --> 00:03:29,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Show mercy.</b></font>

27
00:03:30,250 --> 00:03:33,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please, I have a son.
He is but a child.</b></font>

28
00:03:35,670 --> 00:03:37,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Silence.</b></font>

29
00:03:37,890 --> 00:03:39,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your trite words move me not.</b></font>

30
00:03:39,890 --> 00:03:42,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've heard them more times
than I can count.</b></font>

31
00:03:56,490 --> 00:03:57,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Mm...</b></font>

32
00:03:58,700 --> 00:04:00,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau sighs]</b></font>

33
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:02,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

34
00:04:05,290 --> 00:04:06,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, demon?</b></font>

35
00:04:06,710 --> 00:04:09,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where is this
supposed child of yours?</b></font>

36
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:13,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At least try peppering
some fact into your fiction,</b></font>

37
00:04:13,090 --> 00:04:14,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would you?</b></font>

38
00:04:23,970 --> 00:04:26,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

39
00:04:29,390 --> 00:04:31,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] The demon-slaying
request came directly</b></font>

40
00:04:31,770 --> 00:04:33,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from Mistress Serie.</b></font>

41
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:35,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wasn't certain
what I would find.</b></font>

42
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:38,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it seems my hometown
was the target</b></font>

43
00:04:38,820 --> 00:04:40,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of the demonic rampage.</b></font>

44
00:04:44,790 --> 00:04:48,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I bear no sentimental attachment
to this place,</b></font>

45
00:04:48,540 --> 00:04:51,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it does sadden me
to see it like this.</b></font>

46
00:04:53,130 --> 00:04:56,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[wood creaks]
-[man breathes shakily]</b></font>

47
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:05,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Genau. You?</b></font>

48
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:08,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Yes.</b></font>

49
00:05:11,390 --> 00:05:12,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] Demons.</b></font>

50
00:05:12,810 --> 00:05:15,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They destroyed the village.</b></font>

51
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:19,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm well aware.
It's been dealt with.</b></font>

52
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:21,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I took care
of the assailants myself.</b></font>

53
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:26,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN]
What about the others?</b></font>

54
00:05:30,460 --> 00:05:33,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're all safe.
Every last one.</b></font>

55
00:05:34,130 --> 00:05:35,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll be all right, too.</b></font>

56
00:05:36,590 --> 00:05:38,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A newly qualified
first-class mage</b></font>

57
00:05:39,010 --> 00:05:40,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is here with me.</b></font>

58
00:05:40,130 --> 00:05:42,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm taking you to her now.</b></font>

59
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:45,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This particular mage has been
blessed with the ability</b></font>

60
00:05:45,260 --> 00:05:47,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to use the Goddess' magic.</b></font>

61
00:05:47,390 --> 00:05:48,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unusual, isn't it?</b></font>

62
00:05:49,430 --> 00:05:52,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She'll be able to heal
your wounds with great ease,</b></font>

63
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:55,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so you can reopen
that shop of yours in no time.</b></font>

64
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder...
Have you finally learned</b></font>

65
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:01,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>how to bake
a decent loaf of bread?</b></font>

66
00:06:02,110 --> 00:06:04,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The only bread that has
crossed my plate recently</b></font>

67
00:06:04,610 --> 00:06:06,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>has been cold and hard.</b></font>

68
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:08,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Something warm
and fresh from the oven</b></font>

69
00:06:08,290 --> 00:06:09,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would be a welcome change.</b></font>

70
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:13,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In truth, it needn't be
either of those things.</b></font>

71
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:16,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd take a heel
from your unsold leftovers</b></font>

72
00:06:16,750 --> 00:06:18,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or a crumb
from an old failure.</b></font>

73
00:06:18,630 --> 00:06:20,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau sighs]</b></font>

74
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not too picky.</b></font>

75
00:06:23,550 --> 00:06:25,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

76
00:06:38,070 --> 00:06:39,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] Mr. Genau...</b></font>

77
00:06:43,530 --> 00:06:46,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Methode sighs]
Bring the injured over here.</b></font>

78
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:47,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Injured?</b></font>

79
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:49,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You needn't spare
my feelings, Methode.</b></font>

80
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:52,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And tact is wasted on him.</b></font>

81
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:53,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's dead.</b></font>

82
00:06:54,830 --> 00:06:56,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He was well past
the point of saving</b></font>

83
00:06:56,710 --> 00:06:58,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by the time I pried him
from the rubble.</b></font>

84
00:06:59,590 --> 00:07:01,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The stench is dreadful.</b></font>

85
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His stomach wound
was already rotting</b></font>

86
00:07:04,010 --> 00:07:05,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when I found him.</b></font>

87
00:07:05,260 --> 00:07:08,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Someone so far gone
can't be saved.</b></font>

88
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yet, even at death's door,</b></font>

89
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:12,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he clung to me with
all the strength he had.</b></font>

90
00:07:24,610 --> 00:07:26,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau grunts]</b></font>

91
00:07:27,410 --> 00:07:29,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] He was the son
of the village baker.</b></font>

92
00:07:29,660 --> 00:07:33,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We played together as children
in these very streets.</b></font>

93
00:07:34,250 --> 00:07:36,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When his father passed,
he took over the shop</b></font>

94
00:07:36,540 --> 00:07:38,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and began baking in his stead.</b></font>

95
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:40,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No matter how much he tried,</b></font>

96
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:42,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>his bread was never very good.</b></font>

97
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:43,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

98
00:07:45,380 --> 00:07:47,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And now I will never
taste it again.</b></font>

99
00:07:49,890 --> 00:07:52,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, at least
with the others beside him,</b></font>

100
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he won't be lonely.</b></font>

101
00:07:55,430 --> 00:07:57,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why does it have to be
them lying here</b></font>

102
00:07:57,770 --> 00:07:59,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>instead of the two of us?</b></font>

103
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:03,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We launch ourselves into peril
of our own free will.</b></font>

104
00:08:03,190 --> 00:08:06,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The people of this village
were given no such choice.</b></font>

105
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:08,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

106
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] If anyone has to die,</b></font>

107
00:08:18,870 --> 00:08:21,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it should be
the first-class mages like us</b></font>

108
00:08:21,170 --> 00:08:23,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who choose a life
of conflict and chaos.</b></font>

109
00:08:23,540 --> 00:08:25,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] Mr. Genau...</b></font>

110
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>By the time the request</b></font>

111
00:08:28,130 --> 00:08:30,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the Chivalric Order of Norm
stationed here</b></font>

112
00:08:30,470 --> 00:08:32,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>reached the northern branch,</b></font>

113
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:35,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this village had already
been destroyed.</b></font>

114
00:08:36,430 --> 00:08:39,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are not responsible
for what happened.</b></font>

115
00:08:41,060 --> 00:08:43,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll take another look
around the village.</b></font>

116
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At this point,</b></font>

117
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:50,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>rest might be more prudent
than reconnaissance.</b></font>

118
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How so?</b></font>

119
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Must you ask?</b></font>

120
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Quiet.</b></font>

121
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:00,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One of my surveilling eyes
was blinded.</b></font>

122
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sensing a lone warrior.</b></font>

123
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:05,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And one mage
trying to stay hidden.</b></font>

124
00:09:05,170 --> 00:09:06,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or is it two?</b></font>

125
00:09:07,170 --> 00:09:08,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] It's two.</b></font>

126
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:11,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] They must be skilled
to have dodged detection.</b></font>

127
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:13,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you think they're enemies?</b></font>

128
00:09:18,310 --> 00:09:20,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't. Looks to me
like they're...</b></font>

129
00:09:23,730 --> 00:09:25,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

130
00:09:32,070 --> 00:09:33,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Frieren, what a surprise.</b></font>

131
00:09:33,990 --> 00:09:34,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Methode sighs]</b></font>

132
00:09:35,620 --> 00:09:38,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Which must mean
the other signature I detected</b></font>

133
00:09:38,250 --> 00:09:40,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>belongs to the
first-class mage, Fern.</b></font>

134
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

135
00:09:42,500 --> 00:09:44,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And who's this?</b></font>

136
00:09:44,130 --> 00:09:45,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Methode, of course.</b></font>

137
00:09:45,420 --> 00:09:48,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the proctor from
the first-class mage exam.</b></font>

138
00:09:48,090 --> 00:09:50,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I believe it was Genau, yes?</b></font>

139
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:52,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I fear you've caught me
backfooted.</b></font>

140
00:09:52,630 --> 00:09:54,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There was so much bloodlust
in that spell,</b></font>

141
00:09:54,890 --> 00:09:56,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd assumed you a demon.</b></font>

142
00:09:57,310 --> 00:10:00,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Was there? I apologize
for the confusion.</b></font>

143
00:10:00,430 --> 00:10:01,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No harm meant.</b></font>

144
00:10:02,230 --> 00:10:03,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I felt it, too.</b></font>

145
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:05,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You had me worried to death
for a moment there.</b></font>

146
00:10:06,020 --> 00:10:07,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Fern, it's okay.</b></font>

147
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:10,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're on our side.
Tell Stark to stand down.</b></font>

148
00:10:10,570 --> 00:10:11,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] All right.</b></font>

149
00:10:15,450 --> 00:10:16,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How curious.</b></font>

150
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suppose, Miss Fern,</b></font>

151
00:10:18,620 --> 00:10:20,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you also received
a demon-slaying request?</b></font>

152
00:10:20,870 --> 00:10:23,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We were just
conveniently located.</b></font>

153
00:10:23,250 --> 00:10:26,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell me, what happened?</b></font>

154
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:27,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

155
00:10:38,100 --> 00:10:39,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you praying for them?</b></font>

156
00:10:40,270 --> 00:10:41,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You mind?</b></font>

157
00:10:41,930 --> 00:10:44,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] No, I don't think so.</b></font>

158
00:10:44,770 --> 00:10:47,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My village was destroyed
by demons, too.</b></font>

159
00:10:48,820 --> 00:10:50,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I see.</b></font>

160
00:10:52,490 --> 00:10:53,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey...</b></font>

161
00:10:54,450 --> 00:10:57,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The whole thing with demons
is that they eat people.</b></font>

162
00:10:58,700 --> 00:11:01,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So why are the bodies
still intact?</b></font>

163
00:11:01,540 --> 00:11:03,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was the same at my village.</b></font>

164
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:07,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who can say? I surely can't.</b></font>

165
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Demons will kill humans</b></font>

166
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:10,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even when they're
perfectly sated.</b></font>

167
00:11:11,550 --> 00:11:13,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The logic eludes me.</b></font>

168
00:11:14,970 --> 00:11:16,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That makes sense.</b></font>

169
00:11:16,220 --> 00:11:18,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The two of you
would be force enough</b></font>

170
00:11:18,220 --> 00:11:19,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for a few stray demons.</b></font>

171
00:11:19,930 --> 00:11:22,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems we were
a step behind this time.</b></font>

172
00:11:22,310 --> 00:11:25,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And all our hurrying
was ultimately for naught.</b></font>

173
00:11:25,350 --> 00:11:27,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not entirely, perhaps.</b></font>

174
00:11:27,190 --> 00:11:30,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a loose end Mr. Genau
wants to tie.</b></font>

175
00:11:30,570 --> 00:11:31,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Hm.</b></font>

176
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:33,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

177
00:11:36,950 --> 00:11:39,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] These men were with
the Chivalric Order of Norm.</b></font>

178
00:11:39,950 --> 00:11:41,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] What is that?</b></font>

179
00:11:41,700 --> 00:11:43,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
We encountered them</b></font>

180
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:45,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the Norm Company territory,
remember?</b></font>

181
00:11:45,370 --> 00:11:47,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're the trading company's
military force.</b></font>

182
00:11:48,710 --> 00:11:51,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm surprised there were
so few of them.</b></font>

183
00:11:51,290 --> 00:11:53,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] A standard number
to see garrisoned</b></font>

184
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:55,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in a village of this size.</b></font>

185
00:11:55,130 --> 00:11:56,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For as few as there were,</b></font>

186
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:58,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they were a greater caliber
of guard</b></font>

187
00:11:58,510 --> 00:11:59,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than the village deserved.</b></font>

188
00:11:59,930 --> 00:12:01,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Uh...</b></font>

189
00:12:01,470 --> 00:12:03,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] The man in the middle
was their captain.</b></font>

190
00:12:03,890 --> 00:12:05,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He was an exceptional soldier</b></font>

191
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:07,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who'd defended
the village for years.</b></font>

192
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:10,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] How surprising.</b></font>

193
00:12:10,980 --> 00:12:14,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The strength he bore
puts Stark's to outright shame.</b></font>

194
00:12:15,190 --> 00:12:18,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, well, that's not exactly
a high bar to clear.</b></font>

195
00:12:18,990 --> 00:12:21,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have you determined
the cause of death?</b></font>

196
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I cast an autopsy spell.</b></font>

197
00:12:23,450 --> 00:12:26,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Consistent with their wounds,
they died to a blade.</b></font>

198
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:29,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Death was instantaneous.</b></font>

199
00:12:29,830 --> 00:12:31,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The demons in the village
were weak.</b></font>

200
00:12:31,830 --> 00:12:33,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Weak enough that
soldiers of this skill</b></font>

201
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>should have obliterated them.</b></font>

202
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:38,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no doubt
the true architect</b></font>

203
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:40,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of this massacre
is still at large.</b></font>

204
00:12:41,890 --> 00:12:44,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Take heart. It would appear
your journey here</b></font>

205
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:46,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>wasn't a waste after all.</b></font>

206
00:12:46,470 --> 00:12:47,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern and Stark sigh]</b></font>

207
00:12:48,390 --> 00:12:49,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Indeed.</b></font>

208
00:12:49,850 --> 00:12:52,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm glad there's some service
we can do these fallen.</b></font>

209
00:12:54,610 --> 00:12:56,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This demon... let's find it</b></font>

210
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:59,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and show it how terrifying
humanity can be.</b></font>

211
00:13:00,150 --> 00:13:01,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

212
00:13:08,750 --> 00:13:10,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Across once.</b></font>

213
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Twice. Hold.</b></font>

214
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Perhaps a jab?</b></font>

215
00:13:17,710 --> 00:13:20,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm no sword fighter,
but those moves are unrealistic.</b></font>

216
00:13:21,340 --> 00:13:22,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] Nevertheless,</b></font>

217
00:13:22,550 --> 00:13:24,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they align
with the knights' wounds.</b></font>

218
00:13:25,890 --> 00:13:27,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It doesn't make sense.</b></font>

219
00:13:28,890 --> 00:13:30,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unless it fought
with two swords.</b></font>

220
00:13:34,190 --> 00:13:35,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aren't you clever?</b></font>

221
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:36,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

222
00:13:37,820 --> 00:13:39,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The first clue about our culprit</b></font>

223
00:13:39,530 --> 00:13:41,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is that demons typically
only conceal their mana</b></font>

224
00:13:41,900 --> 00:13:43,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for short bursts.</b></font>

225
00:13:43,280 --> 00:13:44,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So we can assume this demon</b></font>

226
00:13:44,620 --> 00:13:47,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is currently outside
mana detection range.</b></font>

227
00:13:47,450 --> 00:13:50,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Meaning the immediate area
around this village is safe.</b></font>

228
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:53,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Genau shared with me
a few nearby locations</b></font>

229
00:13:53,710 --> 00:13:56,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where demons are known
to establish bases.</b></font>

230
00:13:57,130 --> 00:13:59,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should focus
our search there.</b></font>

231
00:13:59,670 --> 00:14:00,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right.</b></font>

232
00:14:03,550 --> 00:14:04,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Hm.</b></font>

233
00:14:10,810 --> 00:14:13,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First, I suppose we should
get dinner out of the way.</b></font>

234
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:16,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your skills are sharper
after a healthy meal.</b></font>

235
00:14:16,190 --> 00:14:17,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Hm.</b></font>

236
00:14:23,070 --> 00:14:25,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're feeding us
more "clunk" bread?</b></font>

237
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:30,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The logistics network can't be
rebuilt overnight, complainer.</b></font>

238
00:14:31,950 --> 00:14:33,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where's Genau?</b></font>

239
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:36,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Last I saw him,
he was still at the church.</b></font>

240
00:14:36,710 --> 00:14:39,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can drop by now
to deliver his share of bread.</b></font>

241
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:41,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait. While you're here,</b></font>

242
00:14:41,420 --> 00:14:43,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we could use your analysis
of the enemy.</b></font>

243
00:14:43,970 --> 00:14:46,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Understanding
its composition is vital.</b></font>

244
00:14:46,930 --> 00:14:49,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] I don't mind being
the delivery boy.</b></font>

245
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:51,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you, Stark.</b></font>

246
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:54,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fill us in.</b></font>

247
00:14:54,520 --> 00:14:56,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are there any new discoveries?</b></font>

248
00:14:56,900 --> 00:14:59,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not prepared to make
a definitive statement</b></font>

249
00:14:59,150 --> 00:15:00,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about the demon's
physical composition</b></font>

250
00:15:00,940 --> 00:15:01,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at this point,</b></font>

251
00:15:02,030 --> 00:15:03,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I do have
a leading theory.</b></font>

252
00:15:03,820 --> 00:15:05,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[crunching]
-Right, then.</b></font>

253
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:07,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should develop
our strategy immediately.</b></font>

254
00:15:13,540 --> 00:15:14,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Huh?</b></font>

255
00:15:15,870 --> 00:15:17,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Methode exclaiming]</b></font>

256
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:18,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>On second thought,</b></font>

257
00:15:18,250 --> 00:15:20,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the war room shall open
after dinner.</b></font>

258
00:15:20,590 --> 00:15:21,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

259
00:15:28,140 --> 00:15:30,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] What now?
Are they ready to move?</b></font>

260
00:15:31,140 --> 00:15:32,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, sir.</b></font>

261
00:15:32,390 --> 00:15:34,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just brought you your dinner.</b></font>

262
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:35,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crunching]</b></font>

263
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:39,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau grunts softly]</b></font>

264
00:15:40,270 --> 00:15:41,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] It's hard.</b></font>

265
00:15:42,110 --> 00:15:43,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark, muffled] I know.</b></font>

266
00:15:44,070 --> 00:15:46,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[in normal voice]
So, what were you doing?</b></font>

267
00:15:47,030 --> 00:15:50,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] In the chaos, the demons
destroyed the church's barrier.</b></font>

268
00:15:51,370 --> 00:15:54,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was simply replacing it
with a stronger one.</b></font>

269
00:15:55,370 --> 00:15:58,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The villagers' corpses
are inside, after all.</b></font>

270
00:15:59,250 --> 00:16:00,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Really?</b></font>

271
00:16:00,880 --> 00:16:03,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You sure you want to leave them
laying on the floor like that?</b></font>

272
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:05,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you need a hand,
I'll help bury them.</b></font>

273
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:08,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm good at manual labor stuff.</b></font>

274
00:16:08,260 --> 00:16:09,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course.</b></font>

275
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:11,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're not from
the Northern Plateau,</b></font>

276
00:16:11,180 --> 00:16:13,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I shouldn't expect you
to understand.</b></font>

277
00:16:13,510 --> 00:16:14,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm?</b></font>

278
00:16:16,180 --> 00:16:18,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Villages here generally
don't have graveyards</b></font>

279
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:20,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like you do in the south.</b></font>

280
00:16:21,310 --> 00:16:22,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] On rare occasion,</b></font>

281
00:16:22,610 --> 00:16:24,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll find one tucked
into the corner</b></font>

282
00:16:24,530 --> 00:16:25,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of a fortress city.</b></font>

283
00:16:26,030 --> 00:16:28,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Other graves are reserved
for nobles</b></font>

284
00:16:28,110 --> 00:16:30,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and protected by
strong barriers.</b></font>

285
00:16:30,530 --> 00:16:32,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The southern border is dotted</b></font>

286
00:16:32,070 --> 00:16:34,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with a series
of common graveyards.</b></font>

287
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:35,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The average man is buried there,</b></font>

288
00:16:35,750 --> 00:16:37,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where there are fewer demons.</b></font>

289
00:16:37,410 --> 00:16:40,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Transporting the corpses
is a massive ordeal.</b></font>

290
00:16:40,330 --> 00:16:43,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Chivalric Order of Norm
sends an escort.</b></font>

291
00:16:44,170 --> 00:16:46,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you know why
the stakes are so high?</b></font>

292
00:16:46,300 --> 00:16:47,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No.</b></font>

293
00:16:48,420 --> 00:16:50,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If they don't practice
great caution,</b></font>

294
00:16:50,260 --> 00:16:51,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the smell of decay</b></font>

295
00:16:51,550 --> 00:16:53,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>will attract bloodthirsty demons
by the score.</b></font>

296
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:57,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It is a truly hellish sight.</b></font>

297
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:59,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not even the bones
are left behind.</b></font>

298
00:17:01,020 --> 00:17:03,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For a long while now,
the Norm Company has campaigned</b></font>

299
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:06,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for the people of the Plateau
to cremate their dead.</b></font>

300
00:17:07,570 --> 00:17:09,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's the kind
of rational thinking</b></font>

301
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:11,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you would expect
from merchants.</b></font>

302
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:12,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I agree with it.</b></font>

303
00:17:15,540 --> 00:17:16,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

304
00:17:17,750 --> 00:17:19,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU]
But the clergy have voiced</b></font>

305
00:17:19,540 --> 00:17:21,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>their opposition
to the practice.</b></font>

306
00:17:21,830 --> 00:17:23,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I also understand
how they feel...</b></font>

307
00:17:24,420 --> 00:17:26,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from deep in my soul.</b></font>

308
00:17:27,050 --> 00:17:28,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To suggest burning people</b></font>

309
00:17:28,340 --> 00:17:30,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who have already suffered
gruesome deaths?</b></font>

310
00:17:30,550 --> 00:17:32,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's simply inhumane.</b></font>

311
00:17:35,220 --> 00:17:38,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Alas, we'll eventually
have to accept it.</b></font>

312
00:17:38,730 --> 00:17:40,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we can't face facts,</b></font>

313
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:43,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>no one will be able
to rest in their homeland.</b></font>

314
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:44,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

315
00:17:46,650 --> 00:17:48,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crunching]</b></font>

316
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:56,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you could only hear us
and not see us,</b></font>

317
00:17:56,450 --> 00:17:58,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you would think we were
kicking rocks.</b></font>

318
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE]
It's a welcome surprise,</b></font>

319
00:17:59,950 --> 00:18:01,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but sharing a meal
with you two</b></font>

320
00:18:01,710 --> 00:18:03,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is certainly surprising.</b></font>

321
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:06,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I had a strong feeling
we would meet again,</b></font>

322
00:18:06,210 --> 00:18:08,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but a village
destroyed by demons</b></font>

323
00:18:08,170 --> 00:18:09,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>wasn't the backdrop I imagined.</b></font>

324
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:11,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
This wasn't in our plan.</b></font>

325
00:18:13,180 --> 00:18:15,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We set up camp on the other side
of the mountain.</b></font>

326
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:18,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was anticipating
a perfectly average stay.</b></font>

327
00:18:18,930 --> 00:18:21,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This request was
quite the shock.</b></font>

328
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:22,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

329
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:23,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren snores]</b></font>

330
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:30,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh? We've got a new buddy.</b></font>

331
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:32,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It looks like he has a letter.</b></font>

332
00:18:33,820 --> 00:18:36,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm very curious as to
what you and Genau are doing</b></font>

333
00:18:36,490 --> 00:18:37,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this far up north.</b></font>

334
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:40,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I find it hard to believe
two other first-class mages</b></font>

335
00:18:40,490 --> 00:18:41,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>just happened to be
milling around</b></font>

336
00:18:41,750 --> 00:18:43,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>near the scene
of the crime.</b></font>

337
00:18:43,210 --> 00:18:45,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's fair. Though,
I can assure you</b></font>

338
00:18:45,420 --> 00:18:47,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there has been
no milling around.</b></font>

339
00:18:47,170 --> 00:18:49,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're both here
on direct orders.</b></font>

340
00:18:49,170 --> 00:18:51,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Serie asked us
to come north</b></font>

341
00:18:51,260 --> 00:18:53,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to contain the demon population.</b></font>

342
00:18:53,260 --> 00:18:55,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] I didn't realize
first-class mages</b></font>

343
00:18:55,590 --> 00:18:57,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>had those kind of obligations.</b></font>

344
00:18:57,260 --> 00:18:59,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm glad I didn't become one.</b></font>

345
00:18:59,140 --> 00:19:00,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't doubt that much.</b></font>

346
00:19:00,810 --> 00:19:03,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I'm actually here
as her apprentice.</b></font>

347
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:04,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is that so?</b></font>

348
00:19:04,810 --> 00:19:05,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] Yes.</b></font>

349
00:19:05,980 --> 00:19:08,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's very typical
for first-class mages</b></font>

350
00:19:08,060 --> 00:19:10,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to become Mistress Serie's
apprentices</b></font>

351
00:19:10,110 --> 00:19:11,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at one point or another.</b></font>

352
00:19:11,730 --> 00:19:12,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now that you say it,</b></font>

353
00:19:12,900 --> 00:19:14,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think I've heard it
mentioned before.</b></font>

354
00:19:14,900 --> 00:19:16,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be proud to know
I turned her down.</b></font>

355
00:19:16,950 --> 00:19:18,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
You're a good girl, Fern.</b></font>

356
00:19:18,780 --> 00:19:20,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So that's why
the two of you gave in</b></font>

357
00:19:20,990 --> 00:19:22,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to Serie's
unreasonable demands.</b></font>

358
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:25,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She must be
running you ragged.</b></font>

359
00:19:25,370 --> 00:19:27,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I promise it isn't so bad.</b></font>

360
00:19:27,330 --> 00:19:28,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If anything,</b></font>

361
00:19:28,710 --> 00:19:31,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wish I could be
of greater use to her.</b></font>

362
00:19:32,590 --> 00:19:33,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My darling mistress</b></font>

363
00:19:33,670 --> 00:19:36,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is a devastatingly
adorable creature.</b></font>

364
00:19:36,800 --> 00:19:38,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is she really?</b></font>

365
00:19:38,470 --> 00:19:40,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] You should know,
Miss Frieren.</b></font>

366
00:19:40,260 --> 00:19:42,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're just as precious
as she is.</b></font>

367
00:19:42,890 --> 00:19:44,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why, thank you.</b></font>

368
00:19:44,390 --> 00:19:45,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern grunts]</b></font>

369
00:19:46,230 --> 00:19:48,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good Mr. Genau
on the other hand...</b></font>

370
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:50,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's a great example
of how not to behave.</b></font>

371
00:19:51,820 --> 00:19:55,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Methode,
do not end up like me.</b></font>

372
00:19:58,070 --> 00:20:00,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Well, now that
our bread is out of the way,</b></font>

373
00:20:01,990 --> 00:20:04,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we have much
strategizing to do.</b></font>

374
00:20:05,830 --> 00:20:09,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] So, how is the analysis
of the enemy coming along?</b></font>

375
00:20:09,380 --> 00:20:10,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm.</b></font>

376
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:12,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU]
Have you learned anything?</b></font>

377
00:20:12,630 --> 00:20:13,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

378
00:20:14,050 --> 00:20:16,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Methode is still putting
together the final details,</b></font>

379
00:20:16,420 --> 00:20:17,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but we're getting closer.</b></font>

380
00:20:18,260 --> 00:20:20,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And there's one thing
that we know for sure.</b></font>

381
00:20:20,800 --> 00:20:21,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

382
00:20:22,390 --> 00:20:23,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Didn't you say</b></font>

383
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:25,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the enemy fought
with two swords?</b></font>

384
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] I did.</b></font>

385
00:20:26,890 --> 00:20:28,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN AND FRIEREN] Huh?</b></font>

386
00:20:28,350 --> 00:20:31,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But upon further investigation,
it seems we were wrong.</b></font>

387
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:32,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The wounds inflicted</b></font>

388
00:20:32,520 --> 00:20:34,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and typical technique
don't align.</b></font>

389
00:20:34,860 --> 00:20:36,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do you mean?</b></font>

390
00:20:36,190 --> 00:20:38,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>While I'm not an expert,</b></font>

391
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:40,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>dual wielding
is all about balance.</b></font>

392
00:20:40,700 --> 00:20:42,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One blade is used for offense</b></font>

393
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:44,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the other reserved
for defensive maneuvers.</b></font>

394
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:48,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The first blade is a longsword
to inflict fatal blows,</b></font>

395
00:20:48,330 --> 00:20:49,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the second blade</b></font>

396
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:51,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is typically
a lighter short sword</b></font>

397
00:20:51,330 --> 00:20:52,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that's easier to move.</b></font>

398
00:20:54,250 --> 00:20:56,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Therefore, we should be
seeing wounds inflicted</b></font>

399
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:58,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from two distinct weapons.</b></font>

400
00:20:58,260 --> 00:20:59,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

401
00:21:02,050 --> 00:21:04,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Isn't it possible that the demon
we're looking for</b></font>

402
00:21:04,390 --> 00:21:06,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is strong enough to wield
two longswords?</b></font>

403
00:21:06,770 --> 00:21:08,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good thought.
We had it, too.</b></font>

404
00:21:09,020 --> 00:21:11,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But after trying
to recreate the same cuts</b></font>

405
00:21:11,270 --> 00:21:12,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we found on the dead,</b></font>

406
00:21:12,480 --> 00:21:15,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we were able to rule out
that possibility.</b></font>

407
00:21:15,610 --> 00:21:16,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Hmm.</b></font>

408
00:21:16,730 --> 00:21:18,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To successfully
reproduce the damage,</b></font>

409
00:21:18,990 --> 00:21:21,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>our movements were
incredibly unrealistic.</b></font>

410
00:21:22,360 --> 00:21:24,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I will warn you
that what comes next</b></font>

411
00:21:24,280 --> 00:21:26,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is pure speculation.</b></font>

412
00:21:28,080 --> 00:21:29,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Speculate freely.</b></font>

413
00:21:32,790 --> 00:21:34,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry. Excuse me.</b></font>

414
00:21:34,330 --> 00:21:35,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was me.</b></font>

415
00:21:37,130 --> 00:21:38,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts]</b></font>

416
00:21:38,260 --> 00:21:39,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Methode sighs]</b></font>

417
00:21:42,380 --> 00:21:44,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ intense music playing]</b></font>

418
00:21:44,850 --> 00:21:46,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Methode grunts softly]</b></font>

419
00:21:48,560 --> 00:21:49,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The enemy...</b></font>

420
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:52,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It wields four blades.</b></font>

421
00:21:54,310 --> 00:21:55,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Interesting.</b></font>

422
00:21:56,190 --> 00:21:58,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Based on all the cuts
on the knights' bodies</b></font>

423
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:00,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the surrounding buildings,</b></font>

424
00:22:00,070 --> 00:22:02,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it was the best conclusion
we could come up with.</b></font>

425
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:03,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

426
00:22:08,410 --> 00:22:10,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Four blades, you say.</b></font>

427
00:22:18,170 --> 00:22:19,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crunches]</b></font>

428
00:22:20,090 --> 00:22:22,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

429
00:23:49,930 --> 00:23:51,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
I'm severely outclassed.</b></font>

430
00:23:51,100 --> 00:23:52,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] You don't have
that choice.</b></font>

431
00:23:52,470 --> 00:23:54,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE] You seem to know
who I am.</b></font>

432
00:23:54,560 --> 00:23:56,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] It's likely
the beast's appearance...</b></font>

433
00:23:56,100 --> 00:23:58,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] One of them
was a demon general.</b></font>

434
00:23:58,100 --> 00:23:59,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU]
"The Divine Revolte."</b></font>

